<title>USA: Intelect president resigns.</title>
<headline>Intelect president resigns.</headline>
<dateline>RICHARDSON, Texas 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Intellect Communications Systems Ltd said Thursday that its president, Peter Leighton, who is also a director, has resigned.</p>
<p>Director Jeremy Posner also resigned, the company said.</p>
<p>Both officials resigned due to the company's decision to relocate its corporate office from Bermuda to Richardson, Texas, Intellect said.</p>
<p>Leighton lives in Bermuda while Posner lives in Israel, the company said.</p>
<p>The company is now looking for replacements, said Herman Frietsch, chairman and chief executive officer.</p>
<p>Intelect makes multimedia transport and switching systems for telecommuncations and networking applications.</p>
</text>
